#: INSTALL.md:1
msgid "Requested installation to work with the Funnel Metadynamics (FM)"
msgstr "Funnel Metadynamics (FM) に必要なインストール"

#: INSTALL.md:3
msgid "Plumed installation"
msgstr "PLUMED のインストール"

#: INSTALL.md:4
msgid ""
"In order to use FM with Plumed it is possible to follow the Plumed tutorial "
"20.001 \"Installing PLUMED\" by Tribello G., making sure to add the flag "
"during the configure:"
msgstr ""
"Tribello G. の Tutorial 20.001「Installing PLUMED」に従い、configure に次の Flag "
"を加えてください。"

#: INSTALL.md:8
msgid "or"
msgstr "または"

#: INSTALL.md:13
msgid "Third-party applications"
msgstr "外部アプリケーション"

#: INSTALL.md:14
msgid ""
"FM requires a set of files as input with a well-defined syntax, which might "
"result difficult to to produce for inexperienced user. For this reason, we "
"have created two ways to automatically create FM inputs:"
msgstr "FM 入力は厳密な構文が必要で、初心者には難しいため、自動作成する2つの方法を用意しました。"

#: INSTALL.md:16
msgid ""
"using a tcl plug in, to be used together with the visualization software "
"VMD;"
msgstr "VMD と組み合わせる Tcl Plugin。"

#: INSTALL.md:17
msgid "a software-free server called Funnel Metadynamics Pre-Processing Tool."
msgstr "追加ソフトウェア不要の Funnel Metadynamics Pre-Processing Tool Server。"

#: INSTALL.md:19
msgid ""
"For the former, you will need to download the tooltip library for tcl "
"together with the plug-in file funnel.tcl and load them through the *source*"
" command in the tk terminal of VMD. The full description of the installation"
" procedure and the links to the necessary code can be found in the paper of "
"the Funnel Metadynamics Advanced Protocol (FMAP) "
"(doi:10.1038/s41596-020-0342-4). Otherwise, the tcl files can be found in "
"the library folder of the "
"[Github](https://github.com/h2nch2co2h/masterclass-22-1.git)."
msgstr ""
"前者は Tcl の tooltip Library と funnel.tcl を取得し、VMD の Tk Console で *source* "
"します。詳細とリンクは Funnel Metadynamics Advanced Protocol "
"(FMAP、doi:10.1038/s41596-020-0342-4) にあります。Tcl は "
"[GitHub](https://github.com/h2nch2co2h/masterclass-22-1.git) の library "
"にもあります。"

#: INSTALL.md:22
msgid ""
"If you wish instead to use the server, there will be no necessity to "
"download the tcl plug in and having a version of VMD installed in your "
"computer."
msgstr "Server を使うなら Tcl Plugin や VMD のインストールは不要です。"

#: INSTALL.md:24
msgid ""
"To be noted that the server still can not run the post-processing analyses, "
"therefore any calculation should either be performed manually by the user "
"(as will be shown in this tutorial) or using the second plug in for VMD "
"ffs.tcl. In this second case, requirements are the same as for funnel.tcl."
msgstr ""
"ただし Server は後処理に未対応なので、手動（この Tutorial で説明）か VMD の ffs.tcl で解析します。後者の要件は "
"funnel.tcl と同じです。"
